@startuml User_Journey_Free_to_Paid
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Conversion Journey\n(Free User to Paid Subscriber)

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 18
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
    ActivityBackgroundColor #37474f
    ActivityBorderColor #78909c
}

|#2c3e50|Free User (Cramerie)|
start
:Active free user with 5+ completed tests;
note right
  **User Profile:**
  - Using app 2-3 weeks
  - Completed Reading/Listening tests
  - Wants to practice Writing
  - Has 30 Lua remaining
end note

:Navigates to Writing test;
:Clicks "Bat dau bai thi";

|#e74c3c|Friction Point #1: AI Grading|
:Sees **Grading Quota Info**;
:Message: "Ban da het luot cham diem AI
mien phi thang nay";
note right
  **Conversion Trigger:**
  User realizes they need
  paid feature to continue
end note

if (Has enough Lua?) then (yes - 20 Lua)
  :Can use Lua for 1 grading;
  :But Lua will run out soon;
else (no)
  :Cannot proceed with AI grading;
endif

:Sees options:
- Mua them Lua
- Nang cap goi;

|#f39c12|Consideration|
:Clicks "Xem cac goi";
:Redirects to **Subscription Page** (/subscription);
:Reviews current usage:
- 18/20 Reading attempts used
- 15/20 Listening attempts used
- 0 AI gradings remaining;

:Compares upgrade options;
note right
  **Value Comparison:**
  
  **Cramerich (79K/mo):**
  - Unlimited attempts
  - 5 AI gradings/month
  - 100 Lua bonus
  
  **Cramerous (149K/mo):**
  - Unlimited attempts
  - 10 AI gradings/month
  - 200 Lua bonus
  - Priority support
end note

|#e74c3c|Friction Point #2: Quota Limit|
:Returns to practice;
:Tries to start another Reading test;
:Sees **Quota Exceeded Modal**;
:Message: "Ban da dat gioi han 20 bai/ky nang";
note right
  **Second Trigger:**
  Even basic practice
  is now limited
end note

:Options:
- Pay 10 Lua per extra attempt
- Upgrade subscription;

|#9b59b6|Decision Point|
:Calculates cost:
- 10 more tests = 100 Lua = 10,000 VND
- Or subscription = 79,000 VND for unlimited;

if (Heavy user?) then (yes)
  :Subscription is better value;
  :Decides to upgrade;
else (no - occasional)
  :Buys Lua pack instead;
  :Journey ends (for now);
  stop
endif

|#3498db|Purchase Flow|
:Clicks "Nang cap len Cramerich";
:Redirects to PayOS checkout;
:Enters payment details;

fork
  :Bank transfer / QR Pay;
fork again
  :Credit/Debit card;
fork again
  :E-wallet (MoMo, ZaloPay);
end fork

:Confirms payment: 79,000 VND;
:PayOS processes payment;

|#27ae60|Conversion Success|
:Payment successful!;
:Redirects to **Success Page**;
note right
  **Immediate Benefits:**
  - 100 Lua credited
  - Unlimited attempts unlocked
  - 5 AI gradings available
end note

:Auto-redirects to Subscription page;
:Sees "Cramerich" badge;
:All limits removed;

|#1abc9c|Post-Conversion|
:Returns to Writing test;
:Starts test with AI grading enabled;
:Completes Task 1 and Task 2;
:Submits for AI grading;
:Receives detailed feedback;
note right
  **Value Delivered:**
  - Band score breakdown
  - Grammar corrections
  - Vocabulary suggestions
  - Sample essay
end note

:Feels investment was worth it;
:Plans to use remaining 4 gradings;
:Becomes regular user;

stop

legend right
  **Conversion Funnel:**
  |= Stage |= Rate |
  | Free Trial | 100% |
  | Hits Limit | 60% |
  | Views Pricing | 40% |
  | Starts Checkout | 15% |
  | Completes Payment | 10% |
  | Retained (30 days) | 7% |
endlegend

@enduml
